            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Saigon Pearl",
            "review_text": "conscienciouseater\nAsia, Peru2983 contributions\n0\nBonus views if you seat near the Koi swimming pool\nAug 2026 • Couples\nThe food ranges from ok to very good. Excellent idea to serve half-and-half pizza. Service is polite and efficient. Prices are high for Vietnam, but they do philanthropy work, so not too bad lah. If you seat by swimming pool, you might sometimes see amazing bodies - both pleasant and offensive.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 27, 2026\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Conscienciouseater,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to share your experience at Pizza 4P’s Saigon Pearl.\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you enjoyed our half-and-half pizza concept and found our service polite and efficient. We also appreciate your understanding regarding our pricing. At Pizza 4P’s, we carefully select quality ingredients and strive to offer our guests delicious food while creating positive value for the community through our philanthropic activities.\n\nYour feedback is a great encouragement for our team to continue improving and creating enjoyable dining experiences for our guests.\n\nThank you once again for your kind review, and we hope to welcome you back to Pizza 4P’s in the future.\nWishing you a wonderful day!\nPizza 4P’s Team.\nRead more\nWritten August 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
