            "review_text": "conscienciouseater\nAsia, Peru2983 contributions\n0\nSupply chain rupture\nJul 2024 • Couples\nThe food ranges from ok to very good. Service is excellent, either friendly staff. Unless you have reservations, the Q can be extremely long, especially at night. The day we went, they didn’t have the ingredients for many of the items we ordered (no fettuccine, no blue cheese).\nWritten July 17, 2024\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr/Ms. Conscienciouseater,\n\nI am Linh Nguyen - Restaurant Manager of Pizza 4P’s Saigon Pearl.\n\nFirst of all, I truly appreciate that you chose Pizza 4P’s Saigon Pearl for your dinner. Next, I really apologize for not giving you the best experience when dining here. I know that you were looking forward to a good experience at our restaurant.\n\nThere are some reasons for this, such as the quality of the ingredients. This has resulted in us not being able to ensure an adequate supply of ingredients to serve your meal. \n\nAfter receiving your feedback. We have worked closely with suppliers to ensure an adequate supply of ingredients for the dishes. As well as internally, we had an emergency meeting and reconsidered the importance of inventory control to ensure customer experience.\n\nI really appreciate your valuable feedback so that we can know things that we need to improve better and better. Hopefully, in the future, you can see improvement and have the best experience at our store.\n\nBest regards,\nLinh Nguyen - Restaurant Manager of Pizza 4P’s Saigon Pearl.\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
