            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Saigon Pearl",
            "review_text": "md0t\n1 contribution\n0\nRude staff demand you sit where they want you to sit\nJun 2022\nI go here often, the food is fine.\n\nIt seems your staff training is too rigid because they will quite happily allow customers to walk out rather than trying to accommodate them. When the restaurant is half empty why would you demand that I sit all the way at the back next to the exit when all the nice seats looking out onto the pool are available?\n\nPlease also stop asking me to fill out the customer satisfaction survey everytime I eat there, it's annoying and intrusive.\nRead more\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 3, 2022",
