            "review_text": "VickyT_TravelBug\nMelbourne, Australia435 contributions\n0\nVery good pizza\nMay 2022 • Couples\nReally good pizza and a great variety of interesting toppings. \nIf you sit up at the bar you can watch them preparing and cooking them in the two big pizza ovens. \nReasonable price and very busy so make a booking in advance.\nWritten May 30, 2022\nPizza 4P's\nDear VickyT_TravelBug\n\nPizza 4p's sincerely thank you for dining at our restaurant and taking the time to leave us a positive review.\n\nWe are happy to know that you are satisfied with our service, and the quality of food. It is a great encouragement for us to continue to bring more great experiences to our value guests through our Mission \"Delivering Wow, Sharing Happiness\"\n\nHope you continue to support Pizza 4P's in the future.\nThank you once again\n\nPizza 4P's Team\nRead more\nWritten May 31, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
